      "1≤m≤5⋅1051 \\leq m \\leq 5 \\cdot 10^51≤m≤5⋅105",
      "1≤c≤1091 \\leq c \\leq 10^91≤c≤109",
      "1≤ui,vi≤n1 \\leq u_i, v_i \\leq n1≤ui​,vi​≤n and ui≠viu_i \\neq v_iui​=vi​",
      "2≤∑n≤1052 \\leq \\sum n \\leq 10^52≤∑n≤105",
      "1≤∑m≤5⋅1051 \\leq \\sum m \\leq 5 \\cdot 10^51≤∑m≤5⋅105",
